      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> Realistically I get one thing through change control before the weekend. Everything else waits for a window, a vendor conversation, or a board that meets fortnightly.\n\nSo I have to choose, and I would rather choose the right one than the one that is easiest to write up. Tell me where the whole list turns.",
